{
 "about": "The tests the Avatar v3 acceptance requires, by name (tools/avatar_builder/avatar_acceptance.py). Each component's tests are every test its patterns match in CnaTests, no more and no fewer: a test that is missing, renamed, disabled, skipped without an entry in allowedSkips, or new and not listed fails the acceptance. After adding, renaming or removing a test, rewrite the lists with avatar_acceptance.py <build> --write-expected and review the diff.",
